  "about_back": "Back",
  "about_title": "In the Forest",
  "about_subtitle": "A forest logic game",
  "about_history_title": "🌳 The story",
  "about_history_body": "In the Forest is originally a logic game designed by Cédric Martinez, published by Djeco under the name Woodanimo in the SoLogic range.\n\nWe wanted to adapt it for mobile to enrich the experience, offering new grids, new elements and new rules.\n\nThe backbone of the challenges remains the same: place forest elements on a board of hexagonal cells, respecting neighbourhood constraints between them.\n\nToday it is a full game:",
  "about_feature_1": "· Solve logic puzzles of increasing difficulty",
  "about_feature_2": "· 4 game modes: Solo, Friend challenges, Daily and ONF",
  "about_feature_3": "· Unlock badges",
  "about_feature_4": "· Level up your rank",
  "about_feature_5": "· Earn seeds and beat time records",
  "about_approach_title": "🎯 Our approach",
  "about_approach_body": "Pedagogical progression is central: each level introduces a new element with its rules, through an animated briefing before the game.\n\nSensitive to environmental issues and the disasters facing forests (fires and drought), we wanted this game to also be an awareness tool.\n\nThe environment is designed to be welcoming — a forest world that surrounds you with animal animations and feel-good music.\n\nThe educational and awareness aspect is expressed in a playful way through the ONF challenge mode. You will be able to unlock cards related to tree species found in French forests.",
  "about_onf_title": "Kromia — ONF Partnership",
  "about_onf_body": "In partnership with ONF — Agir pour la forêt, we wanted to contribute to field actions by donating a portion of the funds collected through the app.\n\nThese funds will be used to replant trees in French forests. The remainder will help promote the game and fund Kromia's future projects.",
  "about_onf_highlight": "For each purchase of the game, 1 euro is donated to the ONF — Agir pour la forêt foundation.",
  "about_onf_ads": "Money collected through ads viewed in the app will also be partially donated to the foundation.",
  "about_team_title": "👥 The team",
  "about_team_body": "Kromia is a game development studio. In the Forest is its first game.\n\nThe founder is Cédric Martinez, who continues his creative work with traditional publishers while developing new projects through Kromia.",
  "about_credit_author": "Author",
  "about_credit_music": "Music",
  "about_credit_dev": "Development",
  "about_credit_illustrations": "Illustrations",
  "about_copyright": "© Kromia — All rights reserved",

